    {
      "title": "Integrate with the parameters held constant",
      "body": "<p>Apply the power rule to each integral. Expand the second integrand before integrating.</p>",
      "recap": "An integral condition becomes an algebraic equation after evaluating the upper and lower limits.",
      "pitfall": "The extra factor x in the second integral multiplies both terms.",
      "pause": "Write the two resulting equations for a and b.",
      "recall": [
